ply
format ascii 1.0
comment Matrices 
element gaussian3D
comment Coordinates in world space for the center of this Gaussians
property float x
property float y
property float z
comment Values used to construct a scale matrix for this gaussian
property float xScale
property float yScale
property float zScale
comment Euler angle values used to construct a rotation matrix for this gaussian
property float alpha
property float beta
property float gamma
comment These two matrices togther can be used to create the covariance
comment Color value of this Gaussian -- This is temporary and more complex material elements will be added soon
property float r
property float g
property float b
property float a
end header
